config BR2_PACKAGE_THS8200
	bool "ths8200 (component video output)"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HAS_UDEV || !BR2_PACKAGE_HAS_UDEV
	help
	  Configure the TI THS8200 video DAC over i2c-dev, from a register
	  file captured off working hardware.

	  This is the HC-800's only proven video output. The ADV7511 HDMI
	  transmitter on the same bus is fitted and answers, but nothing
	  configures it even under the vendor OS, so component is what
	  actually produces a picture.

	  Needs CONFIG_I2C_CHARDEV and CONFIG_I2C_I801 in the kernel.
